# Per-project SwarmForge launch overrides. Sourced by the swarmforge
# launcher before per-role model and effort are resolved. Plain zsh
# assignments only. No secrets in this file; it is committed.
#
# Fleet policy: no codex. Model rule, operator-set 2026-10-28: architects run
# Opus 5.5 and coders run Sonnet 5.5. The specifier does the architect's job
# here, so it is pinned to Opus 5.5 to match. refactorer is pinned to Opus for
# a different reason (its catch-all default would otherwise just inherit
# whatever model the claude CLI defaults to); it is outside the rule.
SWARMFORGE_SPECIFIER_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
SWARMFORGE_REFACTORER_MODEL=claude-opus-4-8

# Coder's one-flip fallback: if grok isn't available, switch the coder
# agent to claude in swarmforge.conf and relaunch. This model only takes
# effect once that flip happens (the grok backend ignores it).
SWARMFORGE_CODER_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5-5
